LOC&PAS TSI : 4.2.10.4.4""" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf :tunnelObjParameter ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" ;
    skos:scopeNote """Wherever category B is not needed, generally the category A has to be understood as the default value.  None  shall be selected when none of A or B fire category is applied for a specific tunnel.
For tunnels shorter than 1km, the fire category according to SRT TSI does not exist."""@en .

